                <div id="overview-valorant" style="display:none">
                    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;margin-bottom:24px;background:var(--bg2);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:6px;padding:24px">
                    <div style="flex:1">
                        <div style="font-size:18px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">Hey, it’s 0x661.</div>
                        <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fg);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:10px">I’m way too tired to keep dumping the game myself, so shoutout to Bear for dumping the game after every update. I repost his dumps on this site to make them easier to browse and read.</div>
                        <div style="font-size:14px;color:var(--fg);line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:14px">Join the Discord: <a href="https://discord.gg/YZJgRkEyVH" target="_blank" style="color:var(--accent2);text-decoration:underline">discord.gg/YZJgRkEyVH</a></div>
                        <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--fg2)">Enjoy the viewer.</div>
                    </div>
                    <div style="flex-shrink:0"><img src="https://files.catbox.moe/oa8lzh.png" style="height:300px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--border)"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="build-bar" id="build-bar-valorant">
                        <div class="build-item"><span class="build-icon">&#9660;</span><span class="label">Build</span><span class="val" id="build-hash-valorant">Loading...</span></div>
                        <div class="build-item"><span class="build-icon">&#9733;</span><span class="label">Target</span><span class="val" id="build-target-valorant">VALORANT-Win64-Shipping.exe</span></div>
                        <div class="build-item"><span class="build-icon">&#9776;</span><span class="label">Size</span><span class="val" id="build-size-valorant">-</span></div>
                        <div class="build-item"><span class="build-icon">&#9650;</span><span class="label">Released</span><span class="val" id="build-date-valorant">-</span></div>
                    </div>
